{
  "id": "6a6718fc1d23eb4d6c69bd31",
  "title": "マインドウェア",
  "created": 1785141505,
  "updated": 1785143208,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a6718fc1d23eb4d6c69bd31",
      "text": "マインドウェア",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141505,
      "updated": 1785141505
    },
    {
      "id": "6a67190b0000000000f0a00c",
      "text": "> マインドウェアとは[David Perkins]が提唱した概念で、記憶されている意思決定や問題解決の際に検索されるルールや手順その他の知識を指す",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141515,
      "updated": 1785141657
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6719980000000000f0a00e",
      "text": ">",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141657,
      "updated": 1785141658
    },
    {
      "id": "6a67199a0000000000f0a00f",
      "text": ">[https://www.igaku-shoin.co.jp/book/detail/105581 「誤診」はなくせるのか？ | 書籍詳細 | 書籍 | 医学書院] 141頁",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141658,
      "updated": 1785141695
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671e5f0000000000f0a030",
      "text": ">",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142880,
      "updated": 1785142882
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671f320000000000f0a03a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785143090,
      "updated": 1785143090
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671e6a0000000000f0a032",
      "text": "[Mindware]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142890,
      "updated": 1785143090
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671f2d0000000000f0a039",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785143086,
      "updated": 1785143086
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671e5f0000000000f0a031",
      "text": "↑誤植なのかおかしい文章だったので少し手を入れました[hoagecko.icon]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142880,
      "updated": 1785142907
    },
    {
      "id": "6a67190b0000000000f0a00d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141515,
      "updated": 1785141515
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6719c90000000000f0a012",
      "text": ">The term “mindware” was coined by David Perkins in his 1996 book Outsmarting IQ: The Emerging Science of Learnable Intelligence, where he argues that there are three types of intelligence: neural, experiential, and reflective.",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141706,
      "updated": 1785141748
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6719f30000000000f0a014",
      "text": "> Perkins [https://study.com/academy/lesson/perkins-theory-of-learnable-intelligence.html describes] [* neural intelligence] as the “hard-wired, original equipment”, or the brain’s hardware that we have to work with initially. This form of intelligence might be genetically determined, and is the type that is often measured by traditional intelligence tests. Neural intelligence might assist you with pattern recognition, time series prediction, signal processes and anomaly detection.",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141748,
      "updated": 1785141764
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6719ca0000000000f0a013",
      "text": ">",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141706,
      "updated": 1785141716
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6719000000000000f0a00a",
      "text": ">[https://nesslabs.com/mindware Mindware: A Theory of Learnable Intelligence - Ness Labs]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141505,
      "updated": 1785141715
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671a070000000000f0a015",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141768,
      "updated": 1785141768
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671a070000000000f0a016",
      "text": "認知科学者の[David Perkins]は、[脳]の[認知領域]を[ハードウェア]と[ソフトウェア]に大別される一種のコンピューターとして解釈し、その活動をneural, experiential, reflectiveの三種に分類し直した",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141768,
      "updated": 1785142860
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6719c60000000000f0a010",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141703,
      "updated": 1785141703
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671be80000000000f0a01d",
      "text": "なお、前掲のNess Labsはこれは生物学的な知見ではなく、あくまで[認知科学]の解釈における仮説であることを再三強調している。",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142249,
      "updated": 1785142869
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671be90000000000f0a01e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142249,
      "updated": 1785143082
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671a9c0000000000f0a018",
      "text": " table:表",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141917,
      "updated": 1785141922
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671adf0000000000f0a01c",
      "text": "  英名\t日本語訳(仮)\t\t根源\t能力の内容",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141984,
      "updated": 1785142288
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671aa20000000000f0a019",
      "text": "  neural intelligence\t神経的知能\t\t遺伝的に決定される肉体的な認知能力\tいわゆる[IQ]が扱う能力は大抵これらしい",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141923,
      "updated": 1785142929
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671acd0000000000f0a01a",
      "text": "  experiential intelligence\t経験的知能\t\t特定の状況に対応する経験の知識\t「[体験格差]」の議論で優位とされるような能力",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785141965,
      "updated": 1785142951
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671ace0000000000f0a01b",
      "text": "  reflective intelligence\t内省的知能\t\t\t神経的知能及び経験的知能を活用する能力 (いわゆる[メタ認知])",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785141967,
      "updated": 1785142952
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6719c60000000000f0a011",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785141703,
      "updated": 1785141703
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671cde0000000000f0a023",
      "text": "　補足",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142494,
      "updated": 1785142496
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671c760000000000f0a020",
      "text": " 内省的知能の部分を「[マインドウェア]」を呼ぶ場合もある",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142391,
      "updated": 1785142917
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671c830000000000f0a022",
      "text": " \t[David Perkins]はそう主張している",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142404,
      "updated": 1785142419
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671c760000000000f0a021",
      "text": " マインドウェアは「科学的・統計的な原理を適用できるように一般的な問題を整理するのに役立つ」という主張",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142391,
      "updated": 1785142597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671cfc0000000000f0a025",
      "text": " \t[Richard E. Nisbett]がマインドウェアの概念をいかに活用するかを扱った著書において主張している",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142524,
      "updated": 1785142563
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671d240000000000f0a026",
      "text": " [認知マルウェア]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142564,
      "updated": 1785142624
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671ce40000000000f0a024",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142501,
      "updated": 1785142501
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671eae0000000000339f08",
      "text": "勘ですが、これは知能というより知性なのでは…いやいや、読んでない段階で迂闊なことを言うのはやめておこう…[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785142959,
      "updated": 1785143056
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671ed00000000000339f0a",
      "text": " Google翻訳を適当に突っ込んだだけなので多分ところどころ間違っていると思います[hoagecko.icon]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785142993,
      "updated": 1785143208
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671f370000000000f0a03b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785143095,
      "updated": 1785143096
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671f160000000000f0a038",
      "text": "[hoagecko.icon]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785143063,
      "updated": 1785143099
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671f3a0000000000f0a03d",
      "text": " 元々『「誤診」はなくせるのか？』を転載…引用をするだけだったところ、なんか元の文章が説明不足というかおかしな文章だったので英語の記事を適当に引用する羽目に",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785143099,
      "updated": 1785143169
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671f810000000000f0a03e",
      "text": " 翻訳機ユーザーなのでヘンな言葉になっていたらすいません",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785143170,
      "updated": 1785143191
    },
    {
      "id": "6a671f3a0000000000f0a03c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785143099,
      "updated": 1785143099
    }
  ]
}